<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:06:27 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Tech Selloff Rolls On as Haven Demand Lifts Bonds: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</link><description>黄金下跌，因为股市继续抛售，投资者等待关键的通胀数据，这可能会影响美联储进一步加息的预期。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets'&gt;通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Declines Ahead of Inflation Data That Will Guide Fed Bets&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:51:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>欧洲企业如何重获优势？</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-do-europe-s-companies-regain-their-edge-video</link><description>欧洲工业企业正面临能源和劳动力成本高企、投资疲软和全球竞争加剧等日益严峻的压力。麦肯锡的研究发现，45% 的欧洲工业企业显示出财务压力或困境的迹象，但认为这种下滑并非不可避免。麦肯锡公司欧洲执行合伙人通德·奥兰雷瓦朱 (Tunde Olanrewaju) 与彭博广播电台的本·博洛斯 (Ben Boulos) 和查尔斯·卡佩尔 (Charles Capel) 一起讨论了欧洲工业竞争力挑战的推动因素以及可以帮助企业反击的转型战略。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-do-europe-s-companies-regain-their-edge-video'&gt;欧洲企业如何重获优势？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：How Do Europe's Companies Regain Their Edge?&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-do-europe-s-companies-regain-their-edge-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:42:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>债券交易员现在对冲加息，削减以后的情景</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/bond-traders-hedge-a-hike-now-cut-later-scenario</link><description>交易员认为利率上升可能会导致经济陷入困境。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/bond-traders-hedge-a-hike-now-cut-later-scenario'&gt;债券交易员现在对冲加息，削减以后的情景&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bond Traders Hedge a Hike Now, Cut Later Scenario&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/bond-traders-hedge-a-hike-now-cut-later-scenario</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:47:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>俄罗斯石油出口增加导致全球供应过剩</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russia-s-elevated-oil-exports-add-to-global-supply-surplus</link><description>今年的出口量高于 2022 年全面入侵乌克兰以来的所有年平均水平&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russia-s-elevated-oil-exports-add-to-global-supply-surplus'&gt;俄罗斯石油出口增加导致全球供应过剩&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Russia’s Elevated Oil Exports Add to Global Supply Surplus&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russia-s-elevated-oil-exports-add-to-global-supply-surplus</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:02:40 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>